        -:   25:/**
        -:   26: * @brief A single base class (PCB_TRACK) represents both tracks and vias, with subclasses
        -:   27: * for curved tracks (PCB_ARC) and vias (PCB_VIA).  All told there are three KICAD_Ts:
        -:   28: * PCB_TRACK_T, PCB_ARC_T, and PCB_VIA_T.
        -:   29: *
        -:   30: * For vias there is a further VIATYPE which indicates THROUGH, BLIND, BURIED, or MICROVIA,
        -:   31: * which are supported by the synthetic KICAD_Ts PCB_LOCATE_STDVIA_T, PCB_LOCATE_BLINDVIA_T,
        -:   32: * PCB_LOCATE_BURIEDVIA_T and PCB_LOCATE_UVIA_T.
        -:   33: */
